LUB is a modified version of BrainrotPolice, based on upstream commit
1f12e4fc599b5c4f6939c813a4e6eb218555c959 (retrieved 2026-09-06).
Changes in LUB 2.0: WindUI interface with three tabs, bundled/local loading,
separate configuration, and egg-only collection directly in the Chicken Farm
script. Only game 137233438285284 and its list entry are included.
Changes in LUB 2.1: restored the original Collect Egg / wait / local Destroy
sequence and one-second ChildAdded delay. The egg listener is connected before
the initial scan; stop/unload guards and WindUI controls remain. Egg-only mode
omits Deposit Eggs and all cash, upgrade, purchase and merge actions.
Changes in LUB 2.2: compact button icon placement, removed in-app version info
and game-feature descriptions, replaced Right Shift with Insert, and direct game joining.
